{"id":"andenken","lemma":"Andenken","pos":"noun","rank":3892,"glosses":["memory; remembrance (especially of a deceased person)","memento; souvenir (something of emotional value kept as a reminder)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/De-Andenken.ogg/De-Andenken.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Andenkens","plural":"Andenken"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich behalte die Speisekarte als Andenken.","en":"I'll keep the menu as a souvenir.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to keep, to retain","l":"behalten"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"menu"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null]},{"text":"Er hat viele Andenken mitgebracht.","en":"He brought back several souvenirs.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"to bring","l":"mitbringen"}]},{"text":"Tom hat viele Andenken zurückgebracht.","en":"Tom brought back several souvenirs.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"to bring back","l":"zurückbringen"}]},{"text":"Letzte Woche versandte ich an ihn einige Andenken aus den Vereinigten Staaten.","en":"Last week, I mailed him some souvenirs from the U.S.","words":[{"g":"last"},{"g":"week"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"united","l":"einig"},null,{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"united","l":"vereinigt"},{"g":"country, state","l":"Staat"}]}]}